/**
 * The `object-fit` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets how the
 * content of a , such as an `img` or `video`, should be resized to fit its container.
 *
 * Initial: fill. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: not accepted.
 *
 * Grammar: fill | none | [contain | cover] || scale-down
